cff-version: 1.2.0
title: FactorTail
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the library and the
  accompanying manuscript.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: O.
    family-names: Shams Solari
  - given-names: F.
    family-names: Pourbabaee
repository-code: "https://github.com/osolari/FactorTail"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of sharp tail asymptotics and efficient
  rare-event simulation for independent and dependent regularly-varying
  factor models, including conditional Monte Carlo estimators,
  multivariate and hidden regular variation diagnostics, and rolling
  VaR/ES forecasting.
keywords:
  - rare-event simulation
  - conditional Monte Carlo
  - regular variation
  - factor models
  - tail risk
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-05-24"
